{
	"title": "Loi uniforme sur [a ; b] : probabilités et espérance",
	"description": "X uniforme sur [a ; b] : P(c ⩽ X ⩽ d) = (d − c)/(b − a), P(X ⩾ c) = (b − c)/(b − a), E(X) = (a + b)/2, P(X = c) = 0 (pièges : (b − a)/2, longueur non divisée, 1/(b − a) pour P(X = c))",
	"grades": ["T_COMP"],
	"points": ["TCOMP-109", "TCOMP-112", "TCOMP-113"],
	"theme": "Probabilités",
	"domain": "Lois à densité",
	"subdomain": "Loi uniforme",
	"level": 1,
	"status": "draft",
	"delay": 60,
	"shared": {
		"blankDefaults": {
			"acceptDecimal": true
		}
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "$X$ suit la loi uniforme sur $\\left[{{a}}\\,;{{b}}\\right]$.\n\nCalcule $P({{c}}\\leqslant X\\leqslant {{d}})$.\n\n$P({{c}}\\leqslant X\\leqslant {{d}})=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "0..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "L",
					"expression": "5..20"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "{{eval:a+L}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "{{eval:a+1}}..{{eval:b-2}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "d",
					"expression": "{{eval:c+1}}..{{eval:b-1}}"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:(d-c)/(b-a)}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Pour la loi uniforme sur $[a\\,;b]$, la probabilité d'un intervalle $[c\\,;d]$ inclus dans $[a\\,;b]$ est $\\dfrac{d-c}{b-a}$ (longueur de l'intervalle sur longueur totale).",
					"$P({{c}}\\leqslant X\\leqslant {{d}})=\\dfrac{ {{d}}-{{c}} }{ {{b}}-{{a}} }=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:(d-c)/(b-a)}}}$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "$X$ suit la loi uniforme sur $\\left[{{a}}\\,;{{b}}\\right]$.\n\nCalcule $P(X\\geqslant {{c}})$.\n\n$P(X\\geqslant {{c}})=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "0..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "L",
					"expression": "5..20"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "{{eval:a+L}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "{{eval:a+1}}..{{eval:b-1}}"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["2*c != a + b"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:(b-c)/(b-a)}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"$X\\geqslant {{c}}$ correspond à l'intervalle $\\left[{{c}}\\,;{{b}}\\right]$, de longueur ${{eval:b-c}}$.",
					"$P(X\\geqslant {{c}})=\\dfrac{ {{b}}-{{c}} }{ {{b}}-{{a}} }=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:(b-c)/(b-a)}}}$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Le temps d'attente $X$ d'un bus, en minutes, suit la loi uniforme sur $\\left[{{a}}\\,;{{b}}\\right]$.\n\nQuel est le temps d'attente moyen ?\n\n$E(X)=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "0..10"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "{{eval:a+5}}..{{eval:a+30}}"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:(a+b)/2}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Pour la loi uniforme sur $[a\\,;b]$, $E(X)=\\dfrac{a+b}{2}$ (le milieu de l'intervalle).",
					"$E(X)=\\dfrac{ {{a}}+{{b}} }{2}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:(a+b)/2;d}}}$ minutes."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "$X$ suit la loi uniforme sur $\\left[{{a}}\\,;{{b}}\\right]$.\n\nCalcule $P(X={{c}})$.\n\n$P(X={{c}})=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "0..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "L",
					"expression": "5..20"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "{{eval:a+L}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "{{eval:a+1}}..{{eval:b-1}}"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "0"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Pour une loi à densité, $P(X=c)=\\displaystyle\\int_{c}^{c}f(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x=0$ : un point isolé a une probabilité nulle.",
					"$P(X={{c}})=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{0}$."
				]
			}
		}
	],
